  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your words have great power to sway listeners’ minds.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Triumph of the Will<sup>GCC</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You add your mythic tier to the result of your Intimidate check to determine the duration that creatures act friendly towards you. If you affect multiple creatures, add one-half your mythic tier (minimum 1) to the number of creatures you can affect, and the DC of your Intimidate check only increases by 1 for each creature after the first.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc17\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
